      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241306/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend tomato paste, apple cider vinegar, maple syrup, molasses, mustard powder, garlic powder, smoked paprika, sea salt, ground black pepper, and sugar together in a blender.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
